, "ap00007j": {"type":"text","parent":"ap00007i","order":"a0","name":"Hollis had outgrown a logo drawn for on…","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Hollis had outgrown a logo drawn for one café in 2014. Four shops, a wholesale list and a subscription service later, every bag, cup and menu looked a little different.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"size":30,"weight":500,"lineHeight":1.3,"typography":{"$ref":"type/heading"}},"fill":{"$ref":"color/ink"}}

, "ap00007k": {"type":"text","parent":"ap00007i","order":"a1","name":"We spent two weeks in the cafés and the…","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"We spent two weeks in the cafés and the roastery before drawing anything. The new identity keeps the round mark regulars knew and adds a label system that tells you origin, roast and brew method at arm's length. Eleven bag designs now come out of one template.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"typography":{"$ref":"type/body-lg"}},"fill":{"$ref":"color/muted"}}

